\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{A sign acting on a fermion fibre}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{Multiplication by a scalar sign changes when that sign flips.
An endomorphism of a single real sign line, however, is unchanged
by conjugating it by a sign. Which fermion fibres can carry a
linear interaction with the [orbit field](fdip-00ZW)?
An operator exchanging a trivial line and a sign line offers a
different response to the same flip.}
